{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"gear-ratio-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"tl","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"gear-ratio-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["gear-ratio-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"fil","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Halimbawa, ZXQPH0000QXZ pagmamaneho ZXQPH0001QXZ ay nagbibigay ng isang ZXQPH0002QXZ: ZXQPH0003QXZ pagbabawas: ZXQPH0004QXZ RPM ay nagiging ZXQPH0005QXZ RPM. Sa isang multi-stage tren, ipasok ang isang pares sa bawat linya; ang bawat pinatatakbo miyembro ay inaasahan na ibahagi ang isang shaft sa susunod na driver.","record_id":"d22dc36d77d2946156ad8114532aa3ac68f71bd5dbd091059464803a4a90273b","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40843674935","seconds":1.4601103148750099,"source":"Divide driven teeth by driver teeth. For example, 20 driving 40 gives a 2:1 reduction: 1,500 RPM becomes 750 RPM. In a multi-stage train, enter one pair per line; each driven member is assumed to share a shaft with the next driver.","source_commit":"e1f72394198c1a94fce448ea14cd79b496701273","source_hash":"74d1b86e60cc6f260f3778d0e30b9c5c5226de292bf19696f4aa75c162d6a363","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Halimbawa, 20 pagmamaneho 40 ay nagbibigay ng isang 2: 1 pagbabawas: 1,500 RPM ay nagiging 750 RPM. Sa isang multi-stage tren, ipasok ang isang pares sa bawat linya; ang bawat pinatatakbo miyembro ay inaasahan na ibahagi ang isang shaft sa susunod na driver.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
